# Production model routing for LOCAL batteries (non-secret values only), snapshot of taxila-web's container env on
# 2026-10-10 15:45 UTC (revision taxila-web--s38431ab-ianv). A local serve.mjs started without these runs a DIFFERENT
# classifier and turn path from production (measured: owner-2 seed 7, 12 defects / 90 turns locally vs 1 / 90 on
# taxila.dev, context ms-r4-4a-owner2-3seeds). Load it AFTER .env.local so it wins:
#   node --env-file=.env.local --env-file=tests/prod/prod-routing.env server/serve.mjs
# Keys, URLs and the cohort hash are deliberately not here. Re-snapshot after any deploy that changes routing env.
DEPLOY_CLASSIFY=grok-4-1-fast-non-reasoning
TAXILA_CLASSIFY_HEDGE_MS=1500
TAXILA_TURN_PREFETCH=on
TAXILA_ACK_AT_MS=1200
TAXILA_DHD_RATE_ASHA=0
TAXILA_DHD_RATE_ARJUN=0
TAXILA_DUPLEX=shadow
TAXILA_STT_MODEL=taxila-live-transcribe
# (TAXILA_HOST=azure is production's too, but it is left out: it tells the server it runs on Azure, which a local box does not)
